          "jcr:lastModifiedBy": "user-482453db0b@example.invalid",
          "text": "<h4>Trident multihole shell</h4>\n<ul>\n<li>Hemispherical acetabular shell</li>\n<li>Arc-deposited with HA</li>\n<li>Compatible with Trident Torx Acetabular Screws</li>\n<li>Sizes:<br>\n<br>\n&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; • 42 – 74mm<br>\n&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; • 42 – 48mm: 8 holes<br>\n&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; • 50mm: 10 holes<br>\n&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; • 52 – 74mm: 12 holes<br>\n</li>\n</ul>\n",
