        "text_77462187": {
          "jcr:primaryType": "nt:unstructured",
          "jcr:lastModifiedBy": "user-482453db0b@example.invalid",
          "text": "<h4>Trident PSL shell (peripheral self locking)</h4>\n<ul>\n<li>Expanded rim geometry1.8mm peripheral press-fit</li>\n<li>Arc-Deposited CPTi (commercially pure titanium)<br>\n</li>\n<li>Available with PureFix HA coating</li>\n<li>Compatible with Trident Torx Acetabular Screws</li>\n<li>Sizes: 40 – 72mm</li>\n<li>Solidback &amp; clusterhole option</li>\n<li>Clusterhole options:<br>\n<br>\n&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; • 40 – 48mm: 3 holes<br>\n&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; • 50 – 72mm: 5 holes<br>\n</li>\n</ul>\n",
